Scope, because this project renders someone's Minecraft world:

* This license covers the code, tests, probes and documentation in this repository.
* It does not cover, and this repository does not contain, any Mojang-owned asset. The
  texture atlas, block models and geometry the renderer uses are baked on your machine from
  a copy of Minecraft: Java Edition 1.20.1 that you own, plus the mod jars that came with
  your own save. Run `npm run bake` and they appear under `build/assets/`.
* It does not cover any world save, player data, server log, or player skin. Those are other
  people's data and this repository deliberately keeps them out: see "What this is not" in
  README.md, and tests/publish-clean.test.mjs, which fails if they come back.
